Output docs/media/hirehub-demo.gif
Output docs/media/hirehub-demo.mp4

Set Shell "zsh"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1200
Set Height 1000
Set Padding 24
Set Framerate 30
Set TypingSpeed 45ms

Hide
Type "make demo"
Enter
Sleep 25s
Ctrl+L
Sleep 500ms

Show
Type "make demo"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 1s
Hide
Sleep 15s
Show
Sleep 6s
